---
// Hero de AstroCarlZ
---

<section class="relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center px-6 pt-24 pb-16 overflow-hidden">
  {/* Círculos decorativos */}
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[400px] h-[400px] md:w-[550px] md:h-[550px] rounded-full border border-dorado/20 pointer-events-none"></div>
<div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[240px] h-[240px] md:w-[320px] md:h-[320px] rounded-full border border-dorado/30 pointer-events-none"></div>
<div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[80px] h-[80px] md:w-[110px] md:h-[110px] rounded-full border border-dorado/40 pointer-events-none"></div>
  {/* Contenido */}
  <div class="relative z-10 text-center max-w-3xl">
    {/* Eyebrow */}
    <p class="font-sans text-xs md:text-sm tracking-wide-elegant text-dorado/80 uppercase mb-8">
      Astrología · Numerología
    </p>

    {/* Título principal */}
    <h1 class="font-serif text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl text-dorado tracking-elegant leading-none mb-6">
      AstroCarlZ
    </h1>

    {/* Subtítulo */}
    <p class="font-serif italic text-xl md:text-2xl text-crema/90 mb-4">
      Lecturas personalizadas de tu carta astral y numerología.
    </p>

    {/* Divider decorativo */}
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 my-8">
      <div class="w-12 h-px bg-dorado/50"></div>
      <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-dorado"></div>
      <div class="w-12 h-px bg-dorado/50"></div>
    </div>

    {/* Descripción */}
    <p class="font-sans text-base md:text-lg text-crema/70 max-w-xl mx-auto mb-10 leading-relaxed">
      Más de 40 años de experiencia interpretando el lenguaje de los astros para
      acompañarte en tu camino.
    </p>

    {/* CTAs */}
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
      <a
        href="https://wa.me/526861614063"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 bg-dorado text-marina font-sans text-sm tracking-wide-elegant uppercase font-medium hover:bg-dorado-light transition-colors duration-300"
      >
        Agendar por WhatsApp
      </a>
      <a
        href="#servicios"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 border border-dorado/50 text-dorado font-sans text-sm tracking-wide-elegant uppercase font-medium hover:bg-dorado/10 transition-colors duration-300"
      >
        Ver servicios
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>